{#
   Dressing Room Dynamics (#dressing-room). Copy unchanged in substance; the
   phone screenshot of the relationship network is replaced by two decorative
   squad scenes, per the redesign's no-screenshots rule.

   The design collapses the four points to three (bonded / friction / unformed)
   and folds "it compounds" into a closing line, which is what this does — the
   fourth point was making the same argument as the closing sentence.
#}
<section class="dressing-room-section" id="dressing-room" aria-labelledby="dr-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="dr-split">
            <div class="dr-main">
                <div class="section-label">Dressing Room Dynamics</div>
                <h2 class="section-title" id="dr-title">YOUR SQUAD HAS OPINIONS ABOUT EACH OTHER</h2>
                <p class="section-sub">Every player carries a live relationship with every teammate. Bonds form between players who train, room and win together. Friction builds between the ones who don't. The network is visible, and it moves.</p>

                <dl class="dr-legend">
                    <div class="dr-legend-row is-bonded">
                        <dt class="pixel">BONDED</dt>
                        <dd>Bonded players lift each other's morale and hold their form through a bad run.</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dr-legend-row is-friction">
                        <dt class="pixel">FRICTION</dt>
                        <dd>Friction drags morale down, and enough of it will turn a dressing room on you.</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dr-legend-row is-unformed">
                        <dt class="pixel">UNFORMED</dt>
                        <dd>Relationships are earned, not assigned. A new signing starts connected to nobody.</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>

                <p class="dr-footer">It compounds: sell the wrong player and you cut three bonds at once. The squad you build is a network, not a list.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="dr-scenes">
                <div class="scene" data-scene="dr1">
                    <img alt="Four pixel squad players lined up together" width="520" height="400" decoding="async">
                </div>
                <div class="scene" data-scene="dr2">
                    <img alt="Two pixel players side by side" width="520" height="400" decoding="async">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
